Bharata finds father absent and questions mother --- Kaikeyi announces father has gone death way --- Bharata collapses lamenting empty royal bed --- Kaikeyi reports king cried Rama Sita Lakshmana dying --- Kaikeyi says Rama wears bark in Dandaka --- Bharata suspects crime asks what Rama did --- Kaikeyi confesses she demanded kingdom and exile --- Kaikeyi urges Bharata to cremate king and rule
